{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}Gabarits — Formulaire d'inscription — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}
{#
  « Gabarits » (issue #843, D10): the four e-mails of the request flow as a
  LIST, each with its state and a pencil to its own page
  (template_edit.html.twig) — the shape of a rental asset's Gabarits page,
  without drag or bin: an e-mail is neither deleted nor reordered.

  The states come from Service\RequestEmailTemplateService::stateOf(),
  whose « À rédiger » is the very test the sender refuses to send without.

  Requires `templates` (slug, name, description, state, state_label) and
  `decision_templates_to_write`.
#}
{% block content %}
    <div class="page-wide">
        {% include 'partials/page_header.html.twig' with { title: "Formulaire d'inscription" } only %}
        {% include '@registration/config/_nav.html.twig' %}

        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Gabarits des e-mails de demande</h2>

                {% if decision_templates_to_write %}
                    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="status">
                        Les gabarits d'acceptation et de refus doivent être rédigés avant le premier envoi. Tant que
                        l'un manque, aucun e-mail de décision ne part, ni à la main ni automatiquement.
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% embed 'partials/list_editor.html.twig' with {
                    list_id: 'registration-template-list',
                    items: templates|map(t => t|merge({id: t.slug})),
                    sortable: false,
                    state_tones: {'default': 'neutral', 'custom': 'info', 'to_write': 'refused'},
                } only %}
                    {% block item_content %}
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-baseline gap-2">
                            <span class="fw-semibold">{{ item.name }}</span>
                            {% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with {
                                status: state_tones[item.state],
                                label: item.state_label,
                            } only %}
                        </div>
                        <div class="small text-body-secondary">{{ item.description }}</div>
                    {% endblock %}
                    {% block item_edit %}
                        <a href="/config/inscriptions/gabarits/{{ item.slug }}"
                           class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                           aria-label="Modifier — {{ item.name }}" title="Modifier — {{ item.name }}">
                            <i class="bi bi-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </a>
                    {% endblock %}
                {% endembed %}

                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
                    Les e-mails de réinscription se règlent dans la
                    <a href="/config/reinscription/reglages">gestion des réinscriptions</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
